    {
      "uid": "zhcn:270fe8489592be3bc2919a1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我，无论如何也选不出要草地还是沙土。\n倒也有适性不明确的原因――",
      "source_fingerprint": "684a12a05a61c50bdfe2d46a73451e42d5c1c7a3dbb738576b594738b647c838",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1019/storytimeline_041019002.json",
      "json_path": [
